  "user_request_original": "Design a 30-layer periodic multilayer coating on SiO2 (Lemarchand) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: alternating hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) layers, starting with hfo2, repeated 15 times for 30 total layers. Optimize individual layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Initialize thicknesses near quarter-wave condition at 550 nm center wavelength. Use measured refractive index data for hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from the material catalog. Total layer count fixed at 30.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Design and optimize a 30-layer planar multilayer stack consisting of alternating HfO2 and SiO2 layers (starting with HfO2) on a semi-infinite SiO2 substrate under normal incidence air illumination. Optimize all 30 layer thicknesses, initialized near quarter-wave condition at 550 nm, to maximize average transmittance in the 1530–1565 nm band and maximize average reflectance in the 400–700 nm band using measured material data.",
